<title>USA: Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging cold.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging cold.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight for the next five days in Brazil's coffee growing regions, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said.</p>
<p>Monday temperatures will be near to above normal, with lows of 50-68 degrees.</p>
<p>Conditions may be slightly cooler by Wednesday, and then milder on Thursday and Friday.</p>
</text>
